 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250828/68af8038bb822.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【比赛战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-03/match2059177date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德国杯-拜仁4-1奥斯纳布吕克 凯恩双响奥利塞、比朔夫破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260903/zhanbao_image_2059177_1788381591_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260903/zhanbao_image_2059177_1788381591_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260903/zhanbao_image_2059177_1788381591_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style=" 51, 51);">奥利塞破门，凯恩点射建功，最终拜仁4-1奥斯纳布吕克晋级德国杯下一轮。</span></p><p><strong><span style=" 51, 51);">【足球动态】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-03/6a9875f201f00native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">致敬！官方：阿根廷下轮所有赛事在第10分钟暂停 为梅西鼓掌1分钟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a588003a4a26_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" 