/p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.11" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022341142605.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.11" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.11" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022341142605.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022341142605.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">西甲官方公布了8月份月度最佳教练候选名单，其中穆里尼奥、弗里克、弗洛雷斯入选。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09-03/6a983c2829738native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">BBC：不买左后卫是曼联的一场理性豪赌 曼联态度强硬绝不溢价买人</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022359574420.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.42" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022359574420.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260902/202609022359574420.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">曼联今夏并没有补强左后卫，转会窗关闭，BBC撰文谈到曼联左后卫的问题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-09